WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Bien. Aquí voy.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Concéntrate. Velocidad.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.500
Soy veloz.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Un ganador. 42 perdedores.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.500
Yo desayuno perdedores.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.000
Desayuno...

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Tal vez debí desayunar. Un desayunito estaría bien.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.000
No, no, no, no, no, concéntrate.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.500
Velocidad.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Soy más que rápido, más que veloz.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Soy un rayo.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.500
- Oye Rayo, ¿listo?

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.500
Claro que sí.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.000
El Rayo está listo.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.000
I'm American made, Bud Light, Chevrolet

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.000
My mama taught me wrong from right

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.000
I was born in the South

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Sometimes I have a big mouth

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:57.000
When I see something that I don't like

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:59.000
I gotta say it

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.500
We been driving this road

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.000
For a mightily long time

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:09.500
Payin' no mind to the signs

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Well, this neighborhood's changed

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.000
It's all been rearranged

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:17.000
We left that change somewhere behind